  "bio": [
    "Winai Teawsomboonkij founded his Thaifoods Group in 1987 with a chicken farm of 20,000 chickens.",
    "He went on to expand into breeding pigs and producing animal feed, taking the company public in 2015.",
    "Winai holds a majority stake with his family in Thaifoods, one of the country's major chicken meat and pork producers.",
    "The company also operates retail shops under the Thaifoods Fresh Market brand to sell food products with more than 600 outlets.",
    "Winai resigned from CEO and director after Thai regulator imposed civil sanctions against him in late 2025 for insider trading."
